<title><![CDATA[@marybethbarone doesn’t play scared. Sure, the internet is muc...]]></title>
<link>https://picnob.com/post/6760136626651656634531</link>
<guid>https://picnob.com/post/6760136626651656634531</guid>
<description>
<![CDATA[
@marybethbarone doesn’t play scared. Sure, the internet is much more sensitive in 6 than it was when she first began her open mic journey 1 years ago. And yes, the risk of getting dragged by keyboard warriors is scarily comparable to ordering a Cobb salad during Cyclospora Summer.“I’m sure some people are going to watch the darker material and think ‘That’s not funny, you shouldn’t joke about that,’” Barone tells Betches editor @msemmasharpe. “But I think if you’re going to do comedy, your goal should be to be your own favorite comedian.”To read our full conversation with Mary Beth Barone spanning the price of fame to the one TV show she had time to watch this year, comment BARONE and we’ll DM you the link!<p><img src="https://prank-arum.github.io/Feeds/Instagram/marybethbarone/6760136626651656634531.jpg">]]>
</description>
